{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主个性及特色情况如何？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主提供的紫微斗数信息，命宫在酉且无主星，需借对宫（卯宫）的星曜安星，而卯宫恰为身宫，主星为紫微（旺）、贪狼（得）。因此命主整个命盘的核心格局为“紫微贪狼”同宫，命身一体。紫微为帝星，具领导欲与自尊心；贪狼为桃花星，主才艺、交际与欲望。卯宫紫贪组合，木土相生，贪狼得地，强化了风流、好享受、多才艺的特质。身宫主导后天发展，此格局常表现为外表有气度、内在欲望强烈、擅长社交、异性缘佳，但也易流于懒散、贪慕虚荣。综合判断，命主个性上具备可靠、有胆识（不怕事）的一面，但因贪狼影响而显懒惰、风流且女人缘好，与选项B最为吻合。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q25", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 27183, "response_id": "e51d304e-a4a1-4c29-be84-0b783d6e66e8", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 244, "completion_tokens": 1244, "total_tokens": 1488, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1031}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 116}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和出生如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据紫微斗数命盘，命宫在申，主星天机（得）与太阴（得），命身同宫。天机星为智谋之星，主聪明、机变；太阴星为阴柔之星，主温和、文雅、细腻。二星同度且皆得地，性格表现为心思灵巧、外表斯文有礼、举止温文，富有谋略但外在气质偏柔。尤其男性命坐太阴，往往面容清秀、待人接物柔和，易被误解为缺乏阳刚之气或“娘娘腔”。此组合不主脾气暴躁冲动，也不主懒散享乐，仗义固执亦非其主要特征。出生家庭方面，机月组合多属平稳，无特殊暴富或赤贫之兆，通常对应寻常家境，故中等家庭较为合理。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q26", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 11815, "response_id": "98031de0-835a-4021-928d-3f740cb794c1", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 284, "completion_tokens": 570, "total_tokens": 854, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 385}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 28}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主喜欢的居家装修风格是？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据紫微斗数命盘，命宫与身宫同宫在申，主星为天机（得）与太阴（得）。天机星属木，主智慧、机变、好奇与精神追求；太阴星属水，主柔美、细腻、内敛、收藏与古典美感。二星同宫，水木清华，形成“机月”格局，命主心思细腻，审美清雅，具有深厚的文化情结与玄学倾向，喜欢安逸幽静、有历史感的环境，对风水、古董等物品易产生兴趣。天机变动之性受太阴静敛之性调和，不喜过于喧闹或极端科技化的装饰，而倾向于富有传统韵味、能承载精神寄托的居所。故而中式复古风格，搭配古董与风水摆件，最能契合其命格特质。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 17324, "response_id": "596e41ea-a86c-400c-bf70-78faeb6aaecd", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 262, "completion_tokens": 776, "total_tokens": 1038, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 589}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 6}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "基于命盘分析，命宫天机、太阴坐申，太阴生年化科。丙辰大限（43–52岁，对应2015–2024年）天机化权，加强了命宫主动求变的特质，适合创业。\n\n流年分析：\n- 2015乙未年，太阴化忌入命宫，直接冲克命宫吉象，不利于开创事业。\n- 2017丁酉年，太阴化禄、天机化科，双双吉化命宫，是十年大限中最有利的契机；天机化科主教育、策划、儿童，太阴化禄亦主阴柔、滋养（如母婴、儿童相关），故与儿童培训领域高度契合。\n- 2018戊戌年，天机化忌入命宫，事业易生阻滞，不宜出国创业。\n- 2019己亥年，流年命宫无直接吉化引动命宫，且田宅宫虽有太阴，但出国创业之象不如2017年明显。\n\n因此，2017年命宫叠吉，最可能是出国创业之年，领域与天机化科关系密切的儿童培训相符。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 65814, "response_id": "eeb71f82-f9fb-4f83-897d-ab6c20f3c446", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 263, "completion_tokens": 3658, "total_tokens": 3921, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3402}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 7}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n命主八字为壬辰日主，生于申月，庚子时，年柱癸丑，地支申子辰三合水局，金水两旺，身强极盛。大运排盘：1973年癸丑年为阴年，男命逆排大运，约6岁起运，2021年（48岁）正行乙卯伤官大运。2021年流年辛丑：\n\n- **十神层面**：辛金为正印，丑土为正官。原局印星已极旺为忌，流年再透正印辛金，构成 **“印旺夺食”** ——大运天干乙木伤官（为用神）被辛金直克，用神受制，主事业财源受阻。\n- **六亲层面**：辛金正印坐下丑土，与年柱癸丑伏吟。年柱为父母宫，丑土为正官（印库）重现，强金伏吟，是长辈宫位重大冲击的征兆。印星对应母亲，大运乙卯伤官，流年印星反克，母亲星受冲克严重。\n- **健康层面**：日主极旺，印星为忌且伏吟年柱，印星在流年透出无制，主母亲健康突发危机。结合2021年仍处全球新冠大疫，辛丑年辛为肺、呼吸系统，丑为聚集、病库，与母亲染疫去世的象高度吻合。\n- **紫微斗数简参**：命宫天机太阴，太阴为母星，生年太阴化科。2021辛丑流年文昌化忌，易损及女性长辈；且太岁丑宫冲照申宫，暗藏忧伤之应。\n\n其他选项：A生意倒闭因大运乙卯本可用，流年夺食致阻，但不及印星伏吟母亲宫位的事象强烈；B刺伤需见阳刃、七杀冲克，原局无显著血光组合；D生意好转与印夺食的实质矛盾。综合判断，母亲落难之象最为突出。\n\n**最终答案：C**", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 52337, "response_id": "7b42ff29-2c6e-4945-8917-28a867f48426", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 263, "completion_tokens": 3011, "total_tokens": 3274, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2538}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 7}}
