{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", "domain": "family", "question": "命主原生家庭父母亲状况？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主提供的出生时间（公历1988年2月15日16时50分，台湾），排定四柱八字为：戊辰 甲寅 庚子 甲申。  \n命主日干庚金生于寅月，财星当令，双甲透干，财旺身弱。年柱戊辰偏印为母，月柱甲寅偏财为父，财印紧贴相克（甲克戊），为父母关系不合之象。地支申子辰三合水局，伤官泄身，加剧动荡，寅申相冲直克月柱父母宫，主家庭易生变故。印星戊土通根年支辰土，为日主喜用，代表母亲对命主有实质庇护；而偏财甲木为忌神，旺而克印，父亲对家庭稳定有负面影响。  \n综合推断，父母婚姻难以维系，离异之象明显，且日主更可能依附母缘。  \n紫微斗数中命宫天机，身宫无主星，父母宫见紫微，虽显贵气，但斗数重点仍需参看四化，然原局父母宫无化曜，结合八字财破印的强烈征验，仍以八字分析为断。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3\\details_2025_b2b_R1_P0_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 89662, "response_id": "d732c6ac-976e-4fa5-8105-b4880b74aff0", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 229, "completion_tokens": 4924, "total_tokens": 5153, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 4646}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 101}}
